  "full_text": "So I said all the random numbers would say Terry is king. Somebody didn't quite understand what I meant by that. Let's say you're going to talk with God with random numbers and you get a response equal to your offering. And you know how around the country there's churches and Catholic churches and how often does the name of the Pope come up in a Catholic church? You know, not very often, you know, maybe once every few months, maybe they mention him or something, right? But they have a Pope, right? So my point is, when you're praying to God and you're talking to him, I'm high priest, okay? And God will acknowledge that. There's one official temple and it will be known, okay? When you talk to God, you get a response equal to what you offer. And so you need to be entertaining. You need to be entertaining as fuck, okay? Don't be boring, right? Don't spam God. Don't ask God for stuff. It's a space alien trading post, okay? You got an alien, he's bored out of his mind. You got some nigger monkey, he's bothering him. He says, get the fuck out. I don't want to talk to you, fucking nigger monkey. Get the fuck out of here. You got somebody who does the song and dance? He says, uh, okay, whatever. Happy, happy, happy, joy, joy. That's beautiful. Nice, nice, nice. Okay, you got somebody who's creative as fuck, and he says, wow, that's pretty good. Yeah, that's almost as exciting as an angel. Isn't that lovely? Okay, I'm bored. Okay, yeah, here, have some fun. And what? So that's the situation, right? Entertain God.",
